ng' in the same sentence. The opening is also a sentence fragment.","suggestedLevel":"l3","excerpts":[{"artifact":"work","quote":"some new informations"},{"artifact":"work","quote":"If you hear that your friend participated on a school activity"}],"uncertainty":"medium"},{"criterionId":"conventions","observation":"Several spelling errors recur ('learm', 'intrested', 'informations') and there is a stray space before a comma. These errors appear repeatedly enough to affect the reader's ease with the text.","suggestedLevel":"l2","excerpts":[{"artifact":"work","quote":"I think it is important to learm from the experience of others."},{"artifact":"work","quote":"You can get intrested and you will want to join"},{"artifact":"work","quote":"and keeps talking about what they experienced , and you found it interesting."}],"uncertainty":"medium"}]}
