{"findings":[{"criterionId":"cohesion","observation":"The essay is written as one continuous block with no paragraph breaks, so the reader has to work harder to follow the shifts between ideas. Phrases like \"so that way\" and \"Not everyone has a same first impression\" do link ideas, but the connections are often unclear. Try starting a new paragraph for each main point, and use clearer linking words (for example, \"However,\" or \"For example,\") to show how each idea relates to your argument.","excerpts":[{"artifact":"work","quote":"so that way when people wants to know you by personality they will know that first impression"},{"artifact":"work","quote":"Not everyone has a same first impression because they had different personality"}],"uncertainty":"medium"},{"criterionId":"syntax","observation":"You use a mix of simple and compound sentences, and you include some subordinate clauses such as \"when you are going to college\" and \"because they had different personality.\" Some sentences run on because several clauses are joined with commas instead of being separated or linked properly. Varying your sentence structures and breaking up the longest sentences would give your writing more control and clarity.","excerpts":[{"artifact":"work","quote":"specially you need it when you are going to college that will help you to save more money"},{"artifact":"work","quote":"The people who experiencing their impression that has already change their life, they are the one who having more self confident"}],"uncertainty":"medium"},{"criterionId":"vocabulary","observation":"You use the words \"impression\" and \"impossible\" many times, which makes the writing repetitive. Some word choices are not quite accurate, such as \"make impossible\" (where a verb like \"make it harder\" or \"stop\" might fit better) and \"sacrifices\" used as a verb. Using a wider range of precise vocabulary, such as \"reputation\" or \"perception\" for \"impression,\" would strengthen your argument.","excerpts":[{"artifact":"work","quote":"it will make impossible"},{"artifact":"work","quote":"they willing to sacrifices to spend time"}],"uncertainty":"medium"},{"criterionId":"phraseology","observation":"Some of your phrases are natural and effective, such as \"try your best\" and \"save more money.\" Others are not standard English collocations, such as \"believe on yourself\" (the usual phrase is \"believe in yourself\") and \"realize that you made a good experience.\" Learning common collocations and fixed expressions would make your writing sound more natural.","excerpts":[{"artifact":"work","quote":"If you try your best to believe on yourself it will make impossible"},{"artifact":"work","quote":"then you will realize that you made a good experience"}],"uncertainty":"medium"},{"criterionId":"grammar","observation":"There are several recurring grammar patterns to work on. Subject-verb agreement is inconsistent (\"some of them is not changing\"), and verb forms after modal and auxiliary verbs need correcting (\"people wants,\" \"they are the one who having\"). Use the base form after \"will\" and \"to,\" and check uncountable and noun forms (\"a same first impression,\" \"they had different personality\"). Reviewing these patterns will help your sentences become more accurate.","excerpts":[{"artifact":"work","quote":"some of them is not changing of their impression"},{"artifact":"work","quote":"so that way when people wants to know you by personality"},{"artifact":"work","quote":"they are the one who having more self confident"},{"artifact":"work","quote":"Not everyone has a same first impression because they had different personality"}],"uncertainty":"low"},{"criterionId":"conventions","observation":"Capitalisation and punctuation need attention. \"If\" is capitalised in the middle of sentences, \"because\" is followed by a capital letter, and commas are missing in places where they would help the reader. The spelling \"what ever\" should be the single word \"whatever.\" Checking capital letters after conjunctions and adding commas before subordinate clauses would improve readability.","excerpts":[{"artifact":"work","quote":"Yes, I agree with this statement because If you try your best"},{"artifact":"work","quote":"Based on this statement impression will change as impossible If they are being"},{"artifact":"work","quote":"what ever you want"}],"uncertainty":"low"}]}
